{"chapter_count":8,"chapters":[{"date":"2024-12-27","gallery_mode":"editorial","id":298,"kind":"chapter","layout":{"edition":"inherit","show_title":false},"position":0,"quote":"","reveal":{"duration":1000,"effect":"fade"},"story":"Morgens erwachen wir mit einem nebeligen Ausblick auf den Genfersee. \nWir machen uns frisch und fahren einige Kilometer einen Berg hinauf und parken an der Straße. Keine Menschen zu sehen, weit und breit nur strahlend weißer Schnee und so machen wir unseren ersten magischen Schneespaziergang. Auf dem Rückweg zum Auto kommt die Sonne raus.","title":"Ankommen im Schnee"},{"date":"","gallery_mode":"editorial","id":68,"kind":"rail","layout":{"edition":"inherit","media_spacing":24,"padding":0,"parent_id":298,"placements":[{"id":"94a70017-7dfe-4479-aa6a-8f6ae118abb9","photo_id":91},{"id":"70667692-2b88-47b8-984a-6fa37deb3cf8","photo_id":92},{"id":"299f8789-1668-48a5-9e4e-d99fcbdda077","photo_id":93},{"id":"691d45d4-a5f7-4c6c-bf8d-b100d622c0d0","photo_id":94},{"id":"cdddd3c1-455e-4757-8217-cdec81c56c0a","photo_id":95},{"id":"d5006a52-874e-48e2-895d-6726da547640","photo_id":96}],"show_title":false},"position":1,"quote":"","reveal":{"duration":1000,"effect":"fade"},"story":"","title":"Horizontale Bildreihe"},{"date":"2024-12-29","gallery_mode":"editorial","id":299,"kind":"chapter","layout":{"edition":"inherit","show_title":false},"position":2,"quote":"","reveal":{"duration":1000,"effect":"fade"},"story":"Unsere Wohnung liegt direkt am Genfersee. Wir spazieren 10 Minuten und schon sind wir direkt am Wasser. Es ist sonnig, mild, kein Vergleich zu den Temperaturen in höheren Gegenden. Unsere Winterjacken hätten auch in der Wohnung bleiben können.","title":"Spaziergang vor der Haustür"},{"date":"","gallery_mode":"editorial","id":69,"kind":"image","layout":{"edition":"inherit","media_spacing":0,"media_spacing_bottom":0,"media_spacing_top":0,"padding":0,"parent_id":299,"placements":[{"id":"023cfa7a-a87c-4537-94a8-1011c6af237f","photo_id":97}],"show_title":false},"position":3,"quote":"","reveal":{"duration":1000,"effect":"fade"},"story":"","title":"Einzelbild"},{"date":"","gallery_mode":"editorial","id":70,"kind":"rail","layout":{"edition":"inherit","media_spacing":24,"padding":72,"parent_id":299,"placements":[{"id":"66266c19-a4c6-4a55-8f6c-ff8b6eb2d4b8","photo_id":98},{"id":"761ec893-4edc-4f3b-8f52-547b854a2014","photo_id":99},{"id":"b77fe221-4683-47b3-ba34-21775ad2dbdb","photo_id":100},{"id":"25648a07-6edc-4307-9afc-a009225b9a4c","photo_id":90}],"show_title":false},"position":4,"quote":"","reveal":{"duration":1000,"effect":"fade"},"story":"","title":"Horizontale Bildreihe"},{"date":"2025-01-01","gallery_mode":"editorial","id":300,"kind":"chapter","layout":{"edition":"inherit","padding":0,"show_title":false},"position":5,"quote":"","reveal":{"duration":1000,"effect":"fade"},"story":"Den ersten Tag des neuen Jahres verbringen wir auf dem Glacier 3000.\nÜber mehrere Skilifte gelangen wir auf diesen unfassbaren Giganten. \nEinmalig weltweit: Eine Hängebrücke, die zwei Berggipfel miteinander verbindet.\nDie Brücke ist 107 Meter lang und 80 Zentimeter breit und bietet eine unglaubliche Aussicht auf die Alpen: Matterhorn, Mont Blanc, Eiger, Mönch und Jungfrau.","title":"Das erste Licht des Jahres"},{"date":"","gallery_mode":"editorial","id":305,"kind":"image","layout":{"edition":"inherit","media_spacing":0,"media_spacing_bottom":0,"media_spacing_top":0,"padding":0,"parent_id":300,"placements":[{"id":"f1d7d9ad-8c67-4a2f-b4a4-465045569774","photo_id":103}],"show_title":false},"position":6,"quote":"","reveal":{"duration":1000,"effect":"fade"},"story":"","title":"Einzelbild"},{"date":"","gallery_mode":"editorial","id":71,"kind":"pair","layout":{"columns":2,"edge_to_edge":true,"edition":"inherit","gap":18,"parent_id":300,"placements":[{"id":"72106dd7-578b-47cc-823c-294e87238370","photo_id":104},{"id":"0b2e4457-0413-4e56-b252-596718d46558","photo_id":105}],"show_title":false},"position":7,"quote":"","reveal":{"duration":1000,"effect":"fade"},"story":"","title":"Bildpaar / Gruppe"}],"closing":"Wir nehmen den letzten Lift des Tages nach unten und werden noch mit einem wunderschönen Sonnenuntergang belohnt. Was für ein Tag.","country":"Schweiz","cover":{"alt":"","chapter_id":null,"credit":"","demo":false,"description":"","edits":{},"featured":false,"height":5152,"id":104,"large_url":"/WANDER/static/media/104-3840.webp","original_url":"/WANDER/static/media/104-3840.webp","position":14,"source_url":"","srcset":"/WANDER/static/media/104-640.webp 640w, /WANDER/static/media/104-1280.webp 1280w, /WANDER/static/media/104-2200.webp 2200w, /WANDER/static/media/104-3840.webp 3840w","taken_at":"2025-01-01T15:48:10","title":"Untitled photograph","url":"/WANDER/static/media/104-1280.webp","width":7728},"cover_focus":null,"cover_id":104,"demo":false,"description":"Vom Chalet im Gegenlicht bis zum Panorama am Neujahrstag. Eine Fotoerzählung über den Winter in den Alpen.","end_date":"2025-01-01","filmstrip_ids":[],"id":8,"introduction":"Wir sind zwischen den Jahren in die Berge gefahren. Die Tage sind kurz, sodass wir nach nach 12 Stunden Fahrt in Montreux ankommen. Es ist bereits dunkel und wir laden noch schnell alles aus. Wir sind schon gespannt auf den Ausblick morgen früh.","is_example":true,"layout":{"dates_from_photos":true,"title_size":122,"title_style":"overlay"},"location":"Berner Oberland","photo_count":16,"photos":[{"alt":"","chapter_id":null,"credit":"","demo":false,"description":"","edits":{},"featured":false,"height":5152,"id":90,"large_url":"/WANDER/static/media/90-3840.webp","original_url":"/WANDER/static/media/90-3840.webp","position":0,"source_url":"","srcset":"/WANDER/static/media/90-640.webp 640w, /WANDER/static/media/90-1280.webp 1280w, /WANDER/static/media/90-2200.webp 2200w, /WANDER/static/media/90-3840.webp 3840w","taken_at":"2024-12-27T11:11:53","title":"Untitled photograph","url":"/WANDER/static/media/90-1280.webp","width":7728},{"alt":"","chapter_id":null,"credit":"","demo":fal